<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">kitabu raεuwθ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc3">RUT</para>
  <para style="mt1">kitabu raεuwθ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">eliymalek d elεilt-es g muwab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />g elweqθ n elHkum n elquDDay eθkan telle elmejaεeθ g elqeεεeθ, yexDem eryaz seg midden n biytleHm g yehuwδa y elqeεεeθ n muwab bac e yedder diyn nette d liwac-es d idrari-s lessen. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />ykan ellesm-es eliymalek, w liwac-es nuεmiy, w idrari-s meHluwn d kelyuwn. w nihnin δ ifratiyyen seg biytleHm g yehuwδa, eδfen elqeεεeθ n muwab eεemren diyn. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />yjaf eliymalek, eryaz n nuεmiy, teqqiym netteθ d idrari-s lessenniyn, <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />elli uγiyn sent δ elwacun timuwabiyyin, icθ ellesm-es εurfe w tissent raεuwθ, eεemren diyn εuddi εecre sniyn. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />usiyn jafen iryazen lessen, meHluwn d kelyuwn, teqqiym nuεmiy menγiyr idrari-s d weryaz-es.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">arjeε y biytleHm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />teεzem netteθ d teslaθ-in-es f weδwal seg elqeεεeθ n muwab εlexaTer tesle diyn elli rebbi ybarex g ecceεb-es yenεem fell-esen s weče. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />teffeγ s teslaθ-in-es seg wemxan elli tkan δiy-s eTTefneθ ebriδ y elqeεεeθ n yehuwδa. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />ten nuεmiy y teslaθ-in-es lessent-tiyn: «enniyγ kul icθ essiy-xmeθ, eθeδwel y elHuwc n yemmes, w rebbi exen-t-yeg elxiyr emmax i θegiymeθ elxiyr diy-ye w g elli jafen, <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />ysehlax-meθ g wafe n erraHeθ, kul icθ g elHuwc n weryaz-es.» usiyn kubneθ, ekkerneθ e tεeyyeĎneθ. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />ennent-es: «la, nexs e neδwel iyδ-em y midden-em.» <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />ter fell-esneθ nuεmiy: «la eθifrax-iw, imette δ θeδwelmeθ iyδ-i? endre g teδiysθ-iw idrari xlaf bac e yeδwel kul icθ essiy-xmeθ γer-s eryaz? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />eδwelmeθ e yessi y midden-exmeθ εlexaTer neč ekbare egget f weγe tikkelt xlaf, w Hette iδekan et-teεlakmeθ elli neč egedde eθaγe iDe eγδe idrari, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />endre δ θrejameθ el δ ekebren? δ θbeTTelmeθ eγe? la eθifrax-iw, neč ettimeθHesserθ egget fell-exmeθ, εlexaTer afus n rebbi meεεač iyδ-i.» <verse eid="RUT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />εeyyeĎneθ xlaf, eθkub εurfe tewessarθ-es trewweH, emme raεuwθ teqqiym iyδ-es.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />tenn-es tewessarθ-es: «enzi, teluwsθ-em teδwel y midden-es d eθrebb-is, eδwel Hette δ cem iyδ-es.» <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />ter fell-es raεuwθ: «e yeθmelg-ec f wedjam d uferq-em. neč meni e θexDmeδ cem δ xeDme w meni e θeεmreδ δ εemre, midden-em δ midden-iw w rebbi-m δ rebbi-w. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />meni e θjafeδ ejafe e mmerδme diyn. w rebbi encalleh ey-yiHaseb kan bεeδe fell-em. w exen-yetferreq kan δ ejafi.» <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />max i t-tezre cadde eSHiyH ugg aδwel iyδ-es tbeTTel seg edwi.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />usiyn exDemneθ lessent el δ eθeδefneθ biytleHm, erneθ elbalen-sneθ elwacun n temuwreθ elkul ennen: «muc θahen δ nuεmiy?» <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />tenn-asen: «y-eθ-nebim-c nuεmiy neba-miyδ murre, εlexaTer rebbi leqdiyr ymermδ-iyδ leHyaθ-iw. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />max i fγe s yah γeri kul cey, yemenni ture yrejε-iyδ rebbi welγri Hette cey, max i θexsem ye-θsemmameθ nuεmiy, w eddunyeθ tuca-iyδ s elqfas εlexaTer rebbi leqdiyr yekkes-iyδ kul cey?» <verse eid="RUT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />w sahen teδwel nuεmiy d raεuwθ temuwabiθ, tesliyθ-es elli teδwel seg elqeεεeθ n muwab, eδefneθ biytleHm g ellewwel n eθmiyre n timzin.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">raεuwθ g ujiymi n buwεez</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />nuεmiy ykan γer-s ensiyb seg eryaz-es, δemuγni seg elεciyreθ n ebiymalek ellesm-es buwεez. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />ten raεuwθ temuwabiθ y nuεmiy: «edj-iyδ exeDme y ujiymi elayme tisbal δeffer elli yreqb-iyδ s tiT n erreHmeθ.» tenn-es: «berre e yelli.» <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />texDem taδef g ujiymi tebδe et-layem δeffer iHeSSaδen. beSSudfe ykan ejiymi-diyn δegli n buwεez, <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />max i yeδwel seg biytleHm, yen y iHeSSaδen: «rebbi y εin-kum.» erren fell-es: «e ybarex δiy-x rebbi.» <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />yen buwεez y weryaz elli ykellefθ s iHeSSaδen: «δ wiyn tefruwxθe?» <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />yer fell-es: «θahen ettefruwxθ temuwabiθ, teδwel d nuεmiy seg elqeεεeθ n muwab. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />tuseδ ten, &lt;edj-miyδ elayme tisbal δeffer iHeSSaδen.&gt; w netteθ dahen seg talji el ture w el-terθaH kan qiqqi.»<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />elweqθ-es yen buwεez y raεuwθ: «esl e yelli, eθemerq-ec eθlaymeδ seg ejiymi xlaf tedjeδ ejimiye, eqqiym ettxeddamin-iw dahen. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />meni emerqen δ emejren berre δeffer-ensen w neč enniyγ y ixeddamin-iw bac m-etqelqen-c. max e θeffuwδeδ berre esw seg tiqlal elli εebben-tent.» <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />tesjeδ s uδm-es y elqeεεeθ tenn-es: «imette treqqebδ-iyδ s tiT n erreHmeθ? w neč etteberraniθ!» <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />yer fell-es buwεez: «sliyγ s elli θegi-t elkul e tewessarθ-em beεεeδ ejafi n weryaz-em, w max i θedj-iδ daddem d yemmem d elqeεεeθ-em elli θemmarweδ δiy-s teseδ-eδ y midden en-tessina-c qebl. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />rebbi erreb n israYiyl em-ixelleS g elli θegi-t. εlexaTer tuseδ-eδ bac e θeεgleδ seddu-wes.» <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />tenn-es: «yelitni eθeqqiymeδ diyme raDi felle, ya siydiy, εlexaTer treyHeδ uwl-iw s edwi-x, reγm elli meni-c seg tixeddemin-ex.»<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />max i yiweD elweqθ n weče yenne-yes buwεez: «est awi eγrum tneqεet g uwδi n uzemmuwr.» teqqiym tme n iHeSSaδen yuwc-es buwεez iyrδen emmeHrqen θeč el δ eθecbeε teHrez elli yeqqiym γer-s. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />tekker δ θlayem yen buwεez y ixeddamin-es: «edjem-teθ eθlayem Hette seg lukδas w et-teεrxem-c, <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />ekkesm-es seg tisbal n lukδas tedjem-teθ eθlayem w et-gelbem-c.»<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />tlayem raεuwθ g ujiymi-diyn el tisemsiyn, teddi elli tlayem-t yeg εuddi tisniyθ ettimzin. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />tqam timzin-diyn teδwel y temuwreθ tesxen y tewessarθ-es nuεmiy elli tlayem-t, tenzeγ tuwc-es eče elli yefDel-es beεεeδ i θeče g ujiymi. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />tencet-teθ tewessarθ-es nuεmiy: «meni i θlayemeδ asse? w meni i θexδmeδ? rebbi e ybarex g elli yerHem-em.» tenn-es f elli texδem γer-s, tenn-es: «ellesm-es buwεez.» <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />tenn-es nuεmiy: «e ybarex δiy-s rebbi elli erreHmeθ-es etteggez f ihelli edderen d elli jafen.» usiyn tenna-yes xlaf: «eryaze δ ensiyb-enne, seg midden-enne.» <verse eid="RUT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />ten raεuwθ: «yenne-y-iyδ zade, &lt;eθbeε iHeSSaδen el δ ekemlen seg emjar-iw elkul.&gt;» <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />ten nuεmiy y tesliyθ-es raεuwθ: «eθefγeδ d tixeddamin-es e yelli, xiyr elli m-iqelleq elγir-es g ujiymi xlaf.» <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />teqqiym raεuwθ d tixeddamin n buwεez et-layem g tisbal el δ eθuqe θemiyre n timzin d iyrδen. teεmer ettewessarθ-es.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">raεuwθ f wennar n buwεez</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />yelle as tenne nuεmiy y raεuwθ: «edj m-Hewme e yelli elHuwc d weryaz eθafeδ δiy-sen erraHeθ-em. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />tay buwεez ensiyb-enne elli tkaneδ d tixeddamin-es δ yδerre timzin ugg ennar δeggiyδ, <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />essiyreδ elHelt-em tfewHeδ imen-em teHfleδ tegzeδ y wennar, emme et-tedj-ec em-yezer kan max e ykemmel eče d weswe. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />εus meni δ yenεes, max e yenεes, eδef tεerr-iyδ ikreεan-es tettekk-iyδ. nette δ m-yen δmette δ θegeδ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />ter fell-es raεuwθ: «elli tenn-it elkul δ θege.»<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />teggez raεuwθ y wennar teg emmax i s-θenne tewessarθ-es nuεmiy. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />max i yeče buwεez yesw yerθaH yuseδ δ yenεes g eccafeθ n elkuδs n timzin, taδef fell-es raεuwθ txettel tεerra-yes ikreεan-es tettekke. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />ugg ezyen niyD yeθHeyyer eryaz yebren, yaf temeTTuwθ tettekke yetwali ikreεan-es. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />yenceδ-t: «δ wiyn cem?» ter fell-es: «texeddemt-ex raεuwθ, er eTTerf nedbec-ex felle εlexaTer cex δ ensiyb-iw elli eθgeddeδ ey-θewyeδ neč d elqeεεeθ-enne.» <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />yenne-s: «e ybarex δiy-m rebbi e yelli. elbhaweθe exθer n elli θegi-t y nuεmiy tewessarθ-em, εlexaTer el-tHewm-ec eryaz seg elεzerre, δ ifqiyren ziyγ δ imuγniyyen. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />w ture eθ-ukδe-c e yelli, elli texseδ eθege. midden n temuwreθ-iw elkul essenen elli cem temeTTuwθ timeθrebbiθ. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />neč mbelHeq eqreb-γem egget, emme yelle Hed eqerb-iw. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />enεes iDe, w talji e nerqeb kan yeqqel e yelhe ess-im, kan yeqqel rahu δ elxiyr, w kan el-yeqqiyl-c tay neč emeθjulle s rebbi elli yedder δ elhiyγ ess-im. etekke el talji.»<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />tettekke yetwali ikreεan-es el talji, emme tekker qebl e yali as εlexaTer buwεez yenne-yes: «eθedjeδ Hette Hed eyessen elli temeTTuwθ tuseδ y wennar.» <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />yenne-s: «uwc-et timelHefθ-em, teTTef-t seg ecwafi-s.» teTTef-t, ykeyla-s sette δ elkiyleθ timzin, yqam fell-es, yaδef temuwreθ. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />teseδ raεuwθ y tewessarθ-es, tenc-et: «δme eySar e yelli?» teHka-yes elli yegeya-s-θ eryaz elkul. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />tenn-es: «yuca-iyδ setteye n elkiyleθ n timzin εlexaTer yenne-y-iyδ: eθ-eδwel-ec y tewessarθ-em ettelfareγθ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />tenn-es tewessarθ-es: «edj enraje nerqeb max δ ykemmel elHkayeθe, εlexaTer eryaz el-yetterθaH kan eθ-ykemmel asse.»<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">buwεez ayeγ raεuwθ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />yali buwεez yetwali elbab n temuwreθ yeqqiym diyn. yeθεedde eryaz elli yenne-yes fell-es y raεuwθ, yenne-s: «est eqqiym iyδ-i. e yeSHib-iw!» yes-iδ yeqqiym. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />usiyn inabe buwεez εecre δ iryazen seg imeqqaren n temuwreθ yenne-sen: «eqqiymeθ dahen.» eqqiymen. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />yen y weryaz-diyn: «nuεmiy teδwel seg muwab w netteθ tezzenze ture elbay n eliymalek ensiyb-enne seg ejiymi, <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />neč etxememe exeεlme, et-tesγeδ ezzaθ n ihelli geεmzen dahen w ezzaθ n imeqqaren n temuwreθ-iw, eHebbe-c Hed eyged et-yeg kan δ cex. kan δ t-tesγeδ esγ-iy, w kan et-tesseγ-ec enn-iyδ bac e sne, εlexaTer beεδ-ex enneč γeri elHeq n wesγe.» yer fell-es: «δ θ-esγe.» <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />yen buwεez: «as elli eθesγeδ ejiymi seg nuεmiy δ θesγeδ zade raεuwθ temuwabiθ, liwac n elmeyyet, bac e θrejεeδ ellesm n elmeyyet y etterxθ-es.» <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />yen eryaz-diyn: «la, el-gedd-ec esγe ejiymi y imen-iw bac e t-fesδe-c etterxθ-iw. esγ-iy δ cex, neč el-gedd-ec esγe.»<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />qebl g israYiyl, max e sγen ziyγ ebedlen, eyekkes ebeyyeε eSSebbeĎ-es yuwc y eccari. θahen tkan elεaδeθ g israYiyl. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />max i yenne eryaz-diyn y buwεez: «esγ-iy y imen-ex.» yekkes eSSebbeĎ-es yuwc y buwεez. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />yen buwεez y iwessaren d elli g eεmzen diyn elkul: «xenyum δ eccuhhaδ elli asse esγiyγ s γer nuεmiy kul cey egli n eliymalek d idrari-s lessen kelyuwn d meHluwn, <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />w elli uγiyγ raεuwθ temuwabiθ liwac n meHluwn bac e rre ellesm-es y etterxθ-es, w el-yetmettiw-c ugg emmas n emmeθen-es d midden n temuwreθ-es. xenyum δ eccuhhaδ asse.» <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />ennen iwessaren d elli HDeren elkul g elbab n temuwreθ: «nečin δ eccuhhaδ, eyedj rebbi temeTTuwθ elli eθaδef elHuwc-ex m raHiyl d leyye elli bnaneθ elHuwc n israYiyl. emlex g efrate, tegeδ ellesm g biytleHm. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />w edj idrari-x elli δ exen-yuc rebbi seg tefruwxθe m elHuwc n fareS elli tiru-θ tamar y yehuwδa.»<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">buwεez d ezzerriyεeθ-es</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />teδwel raεuwθ δ liwac n buwεez, yaδef fell-es yuwc-es rebbi t-aru efruwx. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />enneneθ elwacun y nuεmiy: «tbark elleh elli yuca-yem asse efruwx eyemmeδxer ellesm-es g israYiyl. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />yejber uwl-em, yqam-em g elkebr-em. tesliyθ-em elli texs-em w elli tiru-θ xiyr n sebεe δ idrari.» <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />tawi nuεmiy efruwx-diyn teθHemmel-θ trebba-θ. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />semmaneθ elwacun n eljiyren enneneθ: «yemmerw-es y nuεmiy efruwx.» w ensemmeθ εuwbiyd. w nette δ daddes n yessa daddes n dawud.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />w iyhen δ ezzerriyεeθ n fareS: fareS yiru HeSruwn, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />w HeSruwn yiru ram, w ram yiru εemminadab, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />w εemminadab yiru neHcuwn, w neHcuwn yiru selmuwn, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />w selmuwn yiru buwεez, w buwεez yiru εuwbiyd, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />w εuwbiyd yiru yessa, w yessa yiru dawud.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>